TITLE:: Parameter
SUMMARY:: Defines a named parameter, type expectation, and validation constraints for a Command.
CATEGORIES:: Control
RELATED:: Classes/Command, Classes/CommandPrompt, Classes/SuggestedValues

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::Parameter:: defines a parameter that a LINK::Classes/Command:: accepts, specifying its expected type (e.g. LINK::Classes/Integer::, LINK::Classes/Float::, LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber::, LINK::Classes/Symbol::, LINK::Classes/String::), whether it accepts a scalar or array of values, and optional value constraints (such as a validation LINK::Classes/Function::, a collection of allowed values, or a LINK::Classes/SuggestedValues:: list that is offered in the prompt but does not reject other values of the parameter type).

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a new TELETYPE::Parameter::.

ARGUMENT:: name
A LINK::Classes/String:: or LINK::Classes/Symbol:: naming the parameter.

ARGUMENT:: type
A LINK::Classes/Class:: specifying the expected argument type.

ARGUMENT:: isArray
A LINK::Classes/Boolean:: indicating whether the parameter accepts a space-separated array of values (defaults to CODE::false::).

ARGUMENT:: constraint
An optional validation LINK::Classes/Function:: returning a boolean, a LINK::Classes/Collection:: of allowed values, or a LINK::Classes/SuggestedValues:: of prompted values. A collection accepts only those values. LINK::Classes/SuggestedValues:: suggests those values and also accepts any other value of the parameter type. Each suggested value must be an instance of CODE::type::.

RETURNS::
A new TELETYPE::Parameter:: instance.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: acceptsCustomValues
Returns whether this parameter accepts values that are not in its suggestion list.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Boolean::. CODE::true:: when CODE::constraint:: is a LINK::Classes/SuggestedValues::, otherwise CODE::false::.

METHOD:: constraint
Returns the constraint function, collection, or suggested-value list, if specified.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Function::, LINK::Classes/Collection::, LINK::Classes/SuggestedValues::, or CODE::nil::.

METHOD:: isArray
Returns whether this parameter expects an array of values.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Boolean::.

METHOD:: isValid
Parses and validates a raw input string.

ARGUMENT:: string
The raw string to parse and validate.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Boolean::.

METHOD:: name
The name of the parameter.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/String::.

METHOD:: parse
Parses a raw input string into the expected type (or array of values).

ARGUMENT:: string
The raw string to parse.

RETURNS::
The parsed value, or CODE::nil:: if parsing fails.

METHOD:: suggestionValues
Returns the values offered as prompt suggestions, when the constraint supplies them.

RETURNS::
An LINK::Classes/Array:: when CODE::constraint:: is a LINK::Classes/Collection:: or a LINK::Classes/SuggestedValues::, otherwise CODE::nil::.

METHOD:: type
The expected LINK::Classes/Class:: for this parameter.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Class::.

METHOD:: validate
Validates a previously parsed value against type and constraint rules.

ARGUMENT:: parsedValue
The parsed value to validate.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Boolean::.

PRIVATE:: init, prParseSingle, prStringIsFloat
